    rdfs:label "Walking a Route yields attention to visual detail"@en, "Eine Strecke gehen schult den Blick fürs Detail"@de ;
    skos:definition "Walking a familiar route with full attention is one of the exercises said to show how lazily we usually see, and so to sharpen notice of detail and subtle change."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:ChaosMagicTmsWbwWalkingARoute ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:ChaosMagicTmsWbwNoticingVisualDetail ;
