pmc:ChaosMagicTmsWbwVoiceAsTranceTool a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Voice as a tool for propelling self and others into trance"@en, "Stimme als Mittel, sich und andere in Trance zu versetzen"@de ;
    skos:definition "The voice is called one of our strongest projective instruments for driving oneself and others into trance."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:WalkingBetweenTheWorlds ;
    dcterms:source "Hine, Walking Between the Worlds: Techniques of Modern Shamanism Volume One (Pagan News Publications, 1986; on-line version of December 1998), Speech Exercises, Gibberish, p. 22; read in the full-text layer of the archive.org item techniques-of-modern-shamanism-vol-1-2-and-3-by-phil-hine-collection, file Hine, Phil - Techniques of Modern Shamanism vol 1_djvu.txt" .

pmc:ChaosMagicTmsWbwVoiceExplorationYieldsVoiceAsTranceTool a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Voice practice yields the voice as a trance tool"@en, "Stimmübung macht die Stimme zum Trancemittel"@de ;
