    rdfs:label "Blind Explorations heighten tactile sensitivity"@en, "Blinde Erkundungen steigern die taktile Empfindsamkeit"@de ;
    skos:definition "Exploring a partner's hands with closed eyes is a beginning exercise for enhancing touch, the sense the section sets out to sharpen."@en ;
    skos:note "The yield is given by the aim of the section, not stated for this exercise alone."@en ;
