pmp:ChaosMagicTmsWbwColourSensing a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Colour Sensing"@en, "Farbertasten"@de ;
    skos:definition "Cut squares of coloured paper; have someone else lay them on a table in an order unknown to you and rig a cover over it that you can reach beneath. Feel for the colour of a square, call it out, and check whether the square you draw out matches. Expect to need much practice to learn to tell the feelings apart and link them to colours."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:WalkingBetweenTheWorlds ;
