    pm:fromWork pmw:TwoWorldsAndInbetween ;
    dcterms:source "Hine, Two Worlds and Inbetween: Techniques of Modern Shamanism Volume II (Pagan News Publications, chapbook, 1989; on-line version of June 1999), Exploring Our Personal Worlds, Shields, p. 11; read in the full-text layer of the archive.org item techniques-of-modern-shamanism-vol-1-2-and-3-by-phil-hine-collection, file Hine, Phil - Techniques of Modern Shamanism vol 2_djvu.txt" .

pmp:ChaosMagicTmsTwiLifePlanShield a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Life-plan shield"@en, "Lebensplan-Schild"@de ;
    skos:definition "Elaborate the shield into a life plan stating where one wants to develop in each segment over a set period; some make fifty-year plans or even 250-year shields envisioning what one wishes to result for the world from one's having lived."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:TwoWorldsAndInbetween ;
    dcterms:source "Hine, Two Worlds and Inbetween: Techniques of Modern Shamanism Volume II (Pagan News Publications, chapbook, 1989; on-line version of June 1999), Exploring Our Personal Worlds, Shields, p. 11; read in the full-text layer of the archive.org item techniques-of-modern-shamanism-vol-1-2-and-3-by-phil-hine-collection, file Hine, Phil - Techniques of Modern Shamanism vol 2_djvu.txt" .

pmp:ChaosMagicTmsTwiGroupShields a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Group Shields"@en, "Gruppenschilde"@de ;
    skos:definition "A group jointly designs and makes a shield expressing its becoming a collective entity, drawing on the force that banners, heraldry and clan tattoos carry."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:TwoWorldsAndInbetween ;
    dcterms:source "Hine, Two Worlds and Inbetween: Techniques of Modern Shamanism Volume II (Pagan News Publications, chapbook, 1989; on-line version of June 1999), Exploring Our Personal Worlds, Shields, p. 12; read in the full-text layer of the archive.org item techniques-of-modern-shamanism-vol-1-2-and-3-by-phil-hine-collection, file Hine, Phil - Techniques of Modern Shamanism vol 2_djvu.txt" .

pmc:ChaosMagicTmsTwiReinforcedGroupIdentityAttractedGroupEnergies a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Reinforced group identity and attracted group energies"@en, "Gestärkte Gruppenidentität und angezogene Gruppenenergie"@de ;
    skos:definition "A group shield is said to strengthen the identity of the group and to draw its energies."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:TwoWorldsAndInbetween ;
    dcterms:source "Hine, Two Worlds and Inbetween: Techniques of Modern Shamanism Volume II (Pagan News Publications, chapbook, 1989; on-line version of June 1999), Exploring Our Personal Worlds, Shields, p. 12; read in the full-text layer of the archive.org item techniques-of-modern-shamanism-vol-1-2-and-3-by-phil-hine-collection, file Hine, Phil - Techniques of Modern Shamanism vol 2_djvu.txt" .

pmc:ChaosMagicTmsTwiGroupShieldYieldsGroupIdentity a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Group shield yields group identity"@en, "Gruppenschild stärkt Gruppenidentität"@de ;
    skos:definition "Making a group shield reinforces group identity and draws group energies."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:ChaosMagicTmsTwiGroupShields ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:ChaosMagicTmsTwiReinforcedGroupIdentityAttractedGroupEnergies ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:TwoWorldsAndInbetween ;
