pmc:ChaosMagicTmsTwiShieldsPowerfulMagicalDevices a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Shields as powerful magical devices"@en, "Schilde als mächtige magische Werkzeuge"@de ;
    skos:definition "With time, both personal and group shields may turn into potent magical devices to be drawn upon in other exercises and activities."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:TwoWorldsAndInbetween ;
    dcterms:source "Hine, Two Worlds and Inbetween: Techniques of Modern Shamanism Volume II (Pagan News Publications, chapbook, 1989; on-line version of June 1999), Exploring Our Personal Worlds, Shields, p. 12; read in the full-text layer of the archive.org item techniques-of-modern-shamanism-vol-1-2-and-3-by-phil-hine-collection, file Hine, Phil - Techniques of Modern Shamanism vol 2_djvu.txt" .

pmc:ChaosMagicTmsTwiShieldWorkYieldsMagicalDevice a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Shield work yields a magical device over time"@en, "Schildarbeit ergibt mit der Zeit ein magisches Werkzeug"@de ;
    skos:definition "Individual and group shields become magical devices with time."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:ChaosMagicTmsTwiShields, pmp:ChaosMagicTmsTwiGroupShields ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:ChaosMagicTmsTwiShieldsPowerfulMagicalDevices ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:TwoWorldsAndInbetween ;
