pmp:ChaosMagicTmsTwiUsingElementalTokens a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Elemental exploration 6: using the tokens"@en, "Elementerkundung 6: die Token verwenden"@de ;
    skos:definition "Build pathworkings on the feelings and images compressed in each token; use the tokens as quarter markers in Centering; choose two complementary qualities per element (e.g. gentleness and strength for earth) to incorporate into oneself; in groups express the elements through dance, games, short plays, mime and soundscapes; go on to explore how elements relate physically, socially and in myth."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
