    dcterms:source "Hine, Touched by Fire: Techniques of Modern Shamanism Volume 3 (Pagan News Publication, 1989; Acrobat conversion of March 1998), Staking out the Territory, Healer, Listening, p. 22; read in the full-text layer of the archive.org item techniques-of-modern-shamanism-vol-1-2-and-3-by-phil-hine-collection, file Hine, Phil - Techniques of Modern Shamanism vol 3_djvu.txt" .

pmc:ChaosMagicTmsTbfListeningBeforeHealingPrerequisite a pm:Presupposing ;
    rdfs:label "Listening before answering"@en, "Zuhören vor dem Antworten"@de ;
    skos:definition "Listening is called a primary skill of every healer; attentive listening is practised first, and further practice in giving a fitting answer follows."@en ;
    pm:priorStep pmp:ChaosMagicTmsTbfEmptyMindListening ;
    pm:dependentStep pmp:ChaosMagicTmsTbfHealingRepertoire ;
