pmc:ChaosMagicTmsTbfHealingHarderCautela a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Healing is harder than it looks"@en, "Heilen ist schwerer, als es scheint"@de ;
    skos:definition "Healing should be approached realistically; a problem you know deep down you cannot do much about is better passed to someone more suitable; if you take it on, ensure you and the client agree how you will approach it and how long the relationship will last."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmp:ChaosMagicTmsTbfHealingRepertoire ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
