pmc:ChaosMagicTmsTbfHealTheEarthYieldsAwareness a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Mass ritual yields raised awareness"@en, "Massenritual ergibt geschärftes Bewusstsein"@de ;
    skos:definition "The Heal the Earth rite aimed at a general rise of awareness of the ecological crisis, a ripple through the planetary human mind."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:ChaosMagicTmsTbfHealTheEarthRitual ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:ChaosMagicTmsTbfCollectiveAwareness ;
