pmp:ChaosMagicTmsTbfHealTheEarthIdea a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "HtE step 1: the idea"@en, "HtE Schritt 1: die Idee"@de ;
    skos:definition "The idea arose among Leeds magicians discussing politicised magick, modelled on the story of covens gathering in the New Forest against Nazi invasion."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:firstPersonReport ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:TouchedByFire ;
    dcterms:source "Hine, Touched by Fire: Techniques of Modern Shamanism Volume 3 (Pagan News Publication, 1989; Acrobat conversion of March 1998), Staking out the Territory, Healer, Heal the Earth, p. 22; read in the full-text layer of the archive.org item techniques-of-modern-shamanism-vol-1-2-and-3-by-phil-hine-collection, file Hine, Phil - Techniques of Modern Shamanism vol 3_djvu.txt" .

pmp:ChaosMagicTmsTbfHealTheEarthRitual a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Organising the Heal the Earth mass ritual"@en, "Organisation des Massenrituals Heal the Earth"@de ;
    skos:definition "A Leeds group conceived a mass ritual linked through one shared image, performed at the solstice by groups and solitary workers: they took the idea to local pagans for feedback, decided on targeting (general awareness rather than specific issues), designed a leaflet with Sheila Broun's Ace of Cups as the linking image, a description of the card and a Tao te Ching passage on water, distributed it widely through networks, and performed the rite at the set time; the author spent two hours drumming on Ilkley Moor in a rite to Arwen."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:firstPersonReport ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:TouchedByFire ;
    dcterms:source "Hine, Touched by Fire: Techniques of Modern Shamanism Volume 3 (Pagan News Publication, 1989; Acrobat conversion of March 1998), Staking out the Territory, Healer, Heal the Earth, pp. 22-24; read in the full-text layer of the archive.org item techniques-of-modern-shamanism-vol-1-2-and-3-by-phil-hine-collection, file Hine, Phil - Techniques of Modern Shamanism vol 3_djvu.txt" .

pmp:ChaosMagicTmsTbfHealTheEarthFeedback a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "HtE step 2: gathering feedback"@en, "HtE Schritt 2: Rückmeldungen einholen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Take the idea to other local pagans for feedback; their enthusiasm is said to have gathered impetus and energy towards success."@en ;
    skos:note "Counts as energy raising toward realising the project."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:firstPersonReport ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:TouchedByFire ;
    dcterms:source "Hine, Touched by Fire: Techniques of Modern Shamanism Volume 3 (Pagan News Publication, 1989; Acrobat conversion of March 1998), Staking out the Territory, Healer, Heal the Earth, p. 23; read in the full-text layer of the archive.org item techniques-of-modern-shamanism-vol-1-2-and-3-by-phil-hine-collection, file Hine, Phil - Techniques of Modern Shamanism vol 3_djvu.txt" .

pmc:ChaosMagicTmsTbfHealTheEarthStages a pm:Sequencing ;
    rdfs:label "Stages of the Heal the Earth project"@en, "Phasen des Projekts Heal the Earth"@de ;
    skos:definition "The Heal the Earth project as Hine tells it, step by step: the idea, feedback from local pagans, the choice of target, the leaflet with its linking image, distribution through networks, and the rite performed at the solstice."@en ;
    rdf:_1 pmp:ChaosMagicTmsTbfHealTheEarthIdea ;
    rdf:_2 pmp:ChaosMagicTmsTbfHealTheEarthFeedback ;
    rdf:_3 pmp:ChaosMagicTmsTbfHealTheEarthTargeting ;
    rdf:_4 pmp:ChaosMagicTmsTbfHealTheEarthLeaflet ;
    rdf:_5 pmp:ChaosMagicTmsTbfHealTheEarthDistribution ;
    rdf:_6 pmp:ChaosMagicTmsTbfHealTheEarthSimultaneousRite ;
    pm:seriesStatement "Hine tells the project as a run of steps, each taken up once the one before was done: the idea, feedback from local pagans, the choice of target, the leaflet, its distribution, and the rite at the solstice; the leaflet carries the target chosen before it, and the rite links up through the image the leaflet spread." ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:TouchedByFire ;
    dcterms:source "Hine, Touched by Fire: Techniques of Modern Shamanism Volume 3 (Pagan News Publication, 1989; Acrobat conversion of March 1998), Staking out the Territory, Healer, Heal the Earth, pp. 22-24; read in the full-text layer of the archive.org item techniques-of-modern-shamanism-vol-1-2-and-3-by-phil-hine-collection, file Hine, Phil - Techniques of Modern Shamanism vol 3_djvu.txt" .

pmp:ChaosMagicTmsTbfHealTheEarthTargeting a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "HtE step 3: targeting"@en, "HtE Schritt 3: Zielsetzung"@de ;
    skos:definition "Decide the target; specific political issues were considered, but a general raising of awareness was chosen."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:firstPersonReport ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:TouchedByFire ;
    dcterms:source "Hine, Touched by Fire: Techniques of Modern Shamanism Volume 3 (Pagan News Publication, 1989; Acrobat conversion of March 1998), Staking out the Territory, Healer, Heal the Earth, p. 23; read in the full-text layer of the archive.org item techniques-of-modern-shamanism-vol-1-2-and-3-by-phil-hine-collection, file Hine, Phil - Techniques of Modern Shamanism vol 3_djvu.txt" .

