    rdfs:label "HtE step 6: the simultaneous rite"@en, "HtE Schritt 6: das gleichzeitige Ritual"@de ;
    skos:definition "At the set time participants worked their rite; the author and others drummed for two hours on Ilkley Moor dedicated to Arwen, focusing on the chalice."@en ;
