pmc:ChaosMagicTmsTbfChaliceEnergyOutcome a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Energy felt pouring into the chalice"@en, "Gefühlte Energie, die in den Kelch strömt"@de ;
    skos:definition "In the weeks before, energy was felt building; during the rite participants all saw and felt a great current of energy flowing into the chalice that focused the working."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as an outcome report, not as a sign announced in advance: in the weeks before the solstice the participants felt energy being raised, and during the rite all of them saw and felt a current pouring into the chalice. The report is of the participants' own perception; no effect on awareness outside the group is reported."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:firstPersonReport ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:TouchedByFire ;
    dcterms:source "Hine, Touched by Fire: Techniques of Modern Shamanism Volume 3 (Pagan News Publication, 1989; Acrobat conversion of March 1998), Staking out the Territory, Healer, Heal the Earth, p. 24; read in the full-text layer of the archive.org item techniques-of-modern-shamanism-vol-1-2-and-3-by-phil-hine-collection, file Hine, Phil - Techniques of Modern Shamanism vol 3_djvu.txt" .

pmc:ChaosMagicTmsTbfAwarenessBeforeAction a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Awareness before action; mass workings empower"@en, "Bewusstsein vor Handeln; Massenarbeiten ermächtigen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Raising awareness is held likelier to work than trying to influence a global situation directly, because acting on a problem needs awareness of it first; mass workings counter the conditioned belief in individual powerlessness by showing one can be effective."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:TouchedByFire ;
    dcterms:source "Hine, Touched by Fire: Techniques of Modern Shamanism Volume 3 (Pagan News Publication, 1989; Acrobat conversion of March 1998), Staking out the Territory, Healer, Heal the Earth, p. 24; read in the full-text layer of the archive.org item techniques-of-modern-shamanism-vol-1-2-and-3-by-phil-hine-collection, file Hine, Phil - Techniques of Modern Shamanism vol 3_djvu.txt" .

pmc:ChaosMagicTmsTbfMassWorkingYieldsEffectiveness a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Mass working yields empowerment"@en, "Massenarbeit ergibt Ermächtigung"@de ;
    skos:definition "Taking part in mass workings is said to remind people that they can act effectively as individuals."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:ChaosMagicTmsTbfHealTheEarthRitual ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:ChaosMagicTmsTbfIndividualEffectiveness ;
